WEBVTT

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:01.381
Sasa, uhamisho wa kinasaba unaweza
kuwa hatari kwa wakina Montague

00:05:01.405 --> 00:05:05.365
waliokuwa na matarajio ya kuwa familia
pekee kwenye mgonjwa waliomshambulia,

00:05:05.365 --> 00:05:06.999
kugawana chembe za urithi
kunachangia

00:05:06.999 --> 00:05:09.777
kwa wakina Capulet kutengeneza
kinga kwa dawa.

00:05:11.747 --> 00:05:16.392
Hivyo wakina Montague wanaanza kuongea
kwa ndani kuondoa hii familia nyingine

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.138
kwa kutoa molekuli hii.

00:05:18.688 --> 00:05:19.838
(Kicheko)

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.062
Na kwa maelezo:

00:05:22.372 --> 00:05:23.978
[Hebu turatibu shambulizi.]

00:05:24.002 --> 00:05:25.293
(Kicheko)

00:05:25.639 --> 00:05:27.430
Hebu turatibu shambulizi.

00:05:29.148 --> 00:05:32.248
Na kila mtu mara moja akaitikia